 "participants": "20 retained of 28 recruited;10 per state-modality condition", "extraSupport": "", "limitations": "Face/gesture used as state differs from reactive face used as reward; intended teaching task, small action/state spaces; faces may be unrelated to robot in natural contexts.", "scopeReason": "Retain task-policy learning with feedback; no imported pretrained action policy is established. The learner/objective and evidence setting are stated separately.", "uncertainties": []}</data></node>
