0 evaluation trials per task, except whole IKEA assembly:10", "participants": "Operator cohort size not specified", "extraSupport": "", "limitations": "Demonstration counts differ in ablation. Evaluation trials are not independent training seeds. Jenga omits real-time corrections; success cannot be attributed uniformly to feedback across tasks. Controlled lab setting.", "scopeReason": "Retain task-policy learning with feedback; no imported pretrained action policy is established. The learner/objective and evidence setting are stated separately.", "uncertainties": ["Do not infer robot manufacturer from photographs or call lab evaluation field deployment."]}</data></node>
