 "Hand-designed scene graph, safety workspace limits, known target/pregrasped ball; time benefit significant for reaching but not placing", "scopeReason": "Retain task-policy learning with feedback; no imported pretrained action policy is established. The learner/objective and evidence setting are stated separately.", "uncertainties": ["Physical arm resembles Sawyer in figure but brand is not confirmed in inspected primary text; label physical arm until verified. Conference 2022, proceedings publication 2023."]}</data></node>
