sessions total.", "participants": "1", "extraSupport": "", "limitations": "The physical implementation explicitly uses gamma = 0, so it learns immediate evaluations. One author teaches predefined primitives; this does not establish long-horizon return optimization.", "scopeReason": "Retain as clearly labelled contextual evidence within interactive learning; its objective or feedback role differs from sequential task-return RL. This is not a recommendation to delete it from the survey.", "uncertainties": []}</data></node>
