curacy90%, a separate metric.", "evaluation": "60 robot actions per subject; per-subject decoder calibration4x90 observation trials", "participants": "7 retained of 9 recruited", "extraSupport": "", "limitations": "Preprogrammed left/right/forward trajectories; personalized EEG calibration and brief synthetic warm start; no manipulation or novel low-level control learning.", "scopeReason": "Retain as clearly labelled contextual evidence within interactive learning; its objective or feedback role differs from sequential task-return RL. This is not a recommendation to delete it from the survey.", "uncertainties": []}</data></node>
