tions": "Real data and hardware testing, but no online real-robot learning loop. Demonstrations remain necessary. Do not call this sim-to-real.", "scopeReason": "Physical recordings are relabeled by model ratings and used to learn a task actor with IQL. The pretrained R3M encoder is not an action policy; no loaded actor checkpoint is described.", "uncertainties": ["Number of physical evaluation trials and independent trained policies remains unclear in the inspected passages.", "Dataset-to-policy procedure supports inclusion, but explicit random weight initialization is not stated in the inspected passages. Do not invent that stronger claim."]}</data></node>
