ack-query budget.", "limitations": "High-level actions abstract away low-level motor control. This is embodied simulation, not physical robotics.", "scopeReason": "New online IQL actor/critic learn from interaction and demonstration-seeded replay. Only the visual encoder is explicitly pretrained; label ALFRED as embodied discrete-action simulation.", "uncertainties": ["Number of physical evaluation trials and independent trained policies remains unclear in the inspected passages."]}</data></node>
