n must be reported.", "scopeReason": "IQL learns a lightweight actor from fixed SO-101 trajectories. No pretrained action-policy initialization is described; this is offline physical-data RL.", "uncertainties": ["No hardware training-seed count found.", "The paper labels DreamZero integration RL, but its described algorithm does not train a policy.", "Offline bowl success is 15%, not 50% or 85%; Figure 7 checked visually.", "Dataset-to-policy procedure supports inclusion, but explicit random weight initialization is not stated in the inspected passages. Do not invent that stronger claim."]}</data></node>
