: "Full method 200 online episodes; sparse baseline 300; one trained run per condition; 20 evaluation sequences", "participants": "", "extraSupport": "Human corrective interventions for unsafe/likely failing actions; equal sampling from demonstration and autonomous replay; sparse insertion reward and resets retained", "limitations": "Attempts within a sequence are clustered; one physical task; gains are from model shaping plus human supervision and task rewards.", "scopeReason": "Appendix D describes offline BC/calibrated-Q optimization of the action head on 40 demos before online ConRFT adaptation. A frozen Octo backbone does not remove the pretrained actor stage.", "uncertainties": ["Do not describe all pretrained parameters as fine-tuned: physical Octo backbone is frozen.", "One training run per reward-model and policy condition is explicitly stated."]}</data></node>
